def paProofNumeralTermAdditionRightCongruenceFirstProof (a b c h p: nat): nat = $ paProofNumeralMPProof (paFormulaEqual a b) (paFormulaImp (paProofNumeralTermAdditionRightCongruenceRef a c) (paProofNumeralTermAdditionRightCongruenceTarget a b c)) h (paProofNumeralTermAdditionRightCongruenceAxiomAnnotation a b c) p (paProofNumeralEqSubstProof (paProofNumeralTermAdditionRightCongruencePhi a c) a b) $;

